      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairfield%2C_Maine",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Fairfield hosts the Fairfield History and Preservation Center, where visitors can explore artifacts that chronicle the town’s mill and agricultural heritage.",
